20:["$","figure",null,{"className":"page-visual page-visual--inline","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/research-2026-10/turin-1280.webp","srcSet":"/images/research-2026-10/turin-640.webp 640w, /images/research-2026-10/turin-1280.webp 1280w","sizes":"(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 1150px) calc(100vw - 64px), 760px","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":"Conceptual illustration for university of turin admissions and scholarships for international students","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"Original conceptual illustration; not a photograph of a named university or scholarship recipient."}]]}]
21:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Use the newly published UniTo cycle and the programme capacity rule",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Use the newly published UniTo cycle and the programme capacity rule"}],[["$","p","The official application page now identifies academic year 2027/28. It lists a €70 application for up to two programmes, postgraduate applications from 25 November 2026 to 29 January 2027, and the stated free-admission undergraduate/single-cycle round from 19 February to 15 April 2027. Do not carry over the former €60 charge or old-cycle dates as current.",{"children":"The official application page now identifies academic year 2027/28. It lists a €70 application for up to two programmes, postgraduate applications from 25 November 2026 to 29 January 2027, and the stated free-admission undergraduate/single-cycle round from 19 February to 15 April 2027. Do not carry over the former €60 charge or old-cycle dates as current."}],["$","p","For visa-requiring non-EU applicants, the page also describes an application cap of four times the programme’s reserved-place quota. That cap concerns applications accepted through the portal, not a promise of four places or a selection probability.",{"children":"For visa-requiring non-EU applicants, the page also describes an application cap of four times the programme’s reserved-place quota. That cap concerns applications accepted through the portal, not a promise of four places or a selection probability."}],["$","p","Original arithmetic example: if a programme’s real published quota were 30, a four-times cap would be 120 accepted applications. The quota, availability, academic conditions and actual portal state must all be checked for that programme. Being able to choose it in a draft does not establish that a complete eligible application has reached its submitted state.",{"children":"Original arithmetic example: if a programme’s real published quota were 30, a four-times cap would be 120 accepted applications. The quota, availability, academic conditions and actual portal state must all be checked for that programme. Being able to choose it in a draft does not establish that a complete eligible application has reached its submitted state."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Use the newly published UniTo cycle and the programme capacity rule","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Use the newly published UniTo cycle and the programme capacity rule"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Check for the actual course",{"scope":"col","children":"Check for the actual course"}],["$","th","Evidence needed",{"scope":"col","children":"Evidence needed"}],["$","th","Misinterpretation to avoid",{"scope":"col","children":"Misinterpretation to avoid"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Correct cycle/round"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"2027/28 category and programme instructions"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Repeating the old year or charge"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Reserved places and portal capacity"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Actual programme quota and current availability"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Cap treated as an admission chance"}]],"$undefined"]}],"$L25"]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b"]}]
