26:["$","section","2-Find your programme before evaluating eligibility",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Find your programme before evaluating eligibility"}],[["$","p","A university name does not identify an admissions route. Start with the degree title, level, teaching language and whether access is restricted. Then check whether you apply as a non-EU visa applicant, an EU/equivalent applicant or a person already legally resident in Italy. The permitted call can change with that category.",{"children":"A university name does not identify an admissions route. Start with the degree title, level, teaching language and whether access is restricted. Then check whether you apply as a non-EU visa applicant, an EU/equivalent applicant or a person already legally resident in Italy. The permitted call can change with that category."}],["$","p","Compare the programme curriculum with your previous study. For a master’s course, identify relevant modules and academic preparation rather than assuming any bachelor’s degree is sufficient. For undergraduate entry, confirm that your school qualification satisfies the required education pathway; ask about a foundation route if it does not.",{"children":"Compare the programme curriculum with your previous study. For a master’s course, identify relevant modules and academic preparation rather than assuming any bachelor’s degree is sufficient. For undergraduate entry, confirm that your school qualification satisfies the required education pathway; ask about a foundation route if it does not."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Exact programme title and campus recorded.",{"children":"Exact programme title and campus recorded."}],["$","li","Qualification and subject requirements checked.",{"children":"Qualification and subject requirements checked."}],["$","li","Applicant category and permitted call confirmed.",{"children":"Applicant category and permitted call confirmed."}],["$","li","Teaching language and accepted evidence saved.",{"children":"Teaching language and accepted evidence saved."}]]}],"$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.en.unito.it/studying-unito/international-degree-seeking-students/required-documents-international-students",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.en.unito.it/studying-unito/international-degree-seeking-students/required-documents-international-students","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Foreign qualification document rules"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
27:["$","section","3-English and Italian requirements: use the actual course rules",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"English and Italian requirements: use the actual course rules"}],[["$","p","There is no safe university-wide promise of admission without IELTS. An English-taught programme may accept specific tests or another documented route; the programme decides what evidence is valid. An English-medium degree letter is useful only when the relevant rules accept it.",{"children":"There is no safe university-wide promise of admission without IELTS. An English-taught programme may accept specific tests or another documented route; the programme decides what evidence is valid. An English-medium degree letter is useful only when the relevant rules accept it."}],["$","p","The international admissions page separately explains Italian evidence for affected Italian-taught undergraduate and single-cycle applicants. Do not transfer those rules to every English-taught master’s programme. In your tracker, record the required language, proof type, score if specified, validity and date by which it must be supplied.",{"children":"The international admissions page separately explains Italian evidence for affected Italian-taught undergraduate and single-cycle applicants. Do not transfer those rules to every English-taught master’s programme. In your tracker, record the required language, proof type, score if specified, validity and date by which it must be supplied."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.en.unito.it/studying-unito/international-degree-seeking-students/application-international-students",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.en.unito.it/studying-unito/international-degree-seeking-students/application-international-students","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"UniTo admission and language instructions"}]]}]]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for English and Italian requirements: use the actual course rules","children":[["$","$L5","/guides/study-in-italy-admission-english-requirements/",{"href":"/guides/study-in-italy-admission-english-requirements/","children":["Italy language requirements and MOI checks",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
28:["$","section","4-Build an application that can be evaluated",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build an application that can be evaluated"}],[["$","p","Make the academic record readable as a whole: qualification, transcript and any required explanation or translation. If the course asks about subject preparation, use the official module evidence instead of an unsupported claim that your degree is equivalent. Match names consistently across your passport and study records.",{"children":"Make the academic record readable as a whole: qualification, transcript and any required explanation or translation. If the course asks about subject preparation, use the official module evidence instead of an unsupported claim that your degree is equivalent. Match names consistently across your passport and study records."}],["$","p","Keep a checklist per programme even where one portal allows two choices. A requirement belonging to the first choice may not satisfy the second. Before paying, verify that the correct programmes and category are selected and that you can meet the relevant call. Save the final receipt and monitor the portal for requests.",{"children":"Keep a checklist per programme even where one portal allows two choices. A requirement belonging to the first choice may not satisfy the second. Before paying, verify that the correct programmes and category are selected and that you can meet the relevant call. Save the final receipt and monitor the portal for requests."}]],["$","ol",null,{"className":"process-steps","aria-label":"Build an application that can be evaluated","children":[["$","li","Open the exact course and its current admission conditions.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":1}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Open the exact course and its current admission conditions."}]]}],["$","li","Check the foreign qualification instructions and exemptions.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":2}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Check the foreign qualification instructions and exemptions."}]]}],["$","li","Prepare the programme-specific academic and language evidence.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":3}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Prepare the programme-specific academic and language evidence."}]]}],["$","li","Complete the correct Apply@UniTo application.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":4}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Complete the correct Apply@UniTo application."}]]}],["$","li","Save submission/payment evidence and read evaluation messages.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":5}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Save submission/payment evidence and read evaluation messages."}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.en.unito.it/studying-unito/international-degree-seeking-students/required-documents-international-students",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.en.unito.it/studying-unito/international-degree-seeking-students/required-documents-international-students","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"UniTo required documents"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
29:["$","section","5-University funding and EDISU: two different routes",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"University funding and EDISU: two different routes"}],[["$","p","The university scholarship page lists different opportunities, including targeted awards and EDISU Piemonte. A named merit award can have a narrower degree, language or nationality scope than the university’s overall international admission. Do not assume a past Talents 4 UniTo call is open or available to every admitted student.",{"children":"The university scholarship page lists different opportunities, including targeted awards and EDISU Piemonte. A named merit award can have a narrower degree, language or nationality scope than the university’s overall international admission. Do not assume a past Talents 4 UniTo call is open or available to every admitted student."}],["$","p","For EDISU, research the regional notice and financial documents independently. An academic offer is useful to your study plan, but it does not replace the benefit application. Compare the documents and timing while you are preparing admission rather than discovering a separate funding deadline afterwards.",{"children":"For EDISU, research the regional notice and financial documents independently. An academic offer is useful to your study plan, but it does not replace the benefit application. Compare the documents and timing while you are preparing admission rather than discovering a separate funding deadline afterwards."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Record each funding route on its own terms","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Record each funding route on its own terms"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Route",{"scope":"col","children":"Route"}],["$","th","Questions to resolve",{"scope":"col","children":"Questions to resolve"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"University or targeted scholarship"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Which programme, cycle and applicant group are covered?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"EDISU Piemonte"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Which financial, academic and enrolment conditions apply?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"MAECI"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Is your nationality and study category eligible in the named call?"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Self-funded plan"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Can you meet tuition and initial living costs while funding is unresolved?"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Source: ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.en.unito.it/studying-unito/scholarships-international-students","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Official guidance"}]]}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for University funding and EDISU: two different routes","children":[["$","$L5","/scholarships/edisu-piemonte/",{"href":"/scholarships/edisu-piemonte/","children":["Detailed EDISU application guide",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/scholarships/maeci-scholarship/",{"href":"/scholarships/maeci-scholarship/","children":["MAECI eligibility and process",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
2a:["$","section","6-Tuition and arrival costs: ask for the right calculation",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Tuition and arrival costs: ask for the right calculation"}],[["$","p","Treat tuition assessment and scholarship selection as separate calculations. The university publishes international fee rules and reduction procedures; confirm which basis applies to your residence and family circumstances. An application fee does not lock in a particular tuition reduction.",{"children":"Treat tuition assessment and scholarship selection as separate calculations. The university publishes international fee rules and reduction procedures; confirm which basis applies to your residence and family circumstances. An application fee does not lock in a particular tuition reduction."}],["$","p","Build a first-year budget with tuition, the relevant regional or administrative charges, rent, food, transport, document costs and an arrival reserve. A later award should reduce the budget only when its scope and timing are clear. Otherwise, keep a confirmed-funding column and a pending-funding column.",{"children":"Build a first-year budget with tuition, the relevant regional or administrative charges, rent, food, transport, document costs and an arrival reserve. A later award should reduce the budget only when its scope and timing are clear. Otherwise, keep a confirmed-funding column and a pending-funding column."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.en.unito.it/studying-unito/tuition-fees/tuition-fees-international-students",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.en.unito.it/studying-unito/tuition-fees/tuition-fees-international-students","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"UniTo international tuition rules"}]]}]]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Tuition and arrival costs: ask for the right calculation","children":[["$","$L5","/tools/italy-study-cost-calculator/",{"href":"/tools/italy-study-cost-calculator/","children":["Estimate Italy costs",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
2b:["$","section","7-After an offer: Universitaly, originals and enrolment",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"After an offer: Universitaly, originals and enrolment"}],[["$","p","For relevant non-EU students abroad, UniTo identifies a separate Universitaly pre-enrolment process. Admission and university validation do not guarantee a visa, and a visa does not remove the university’s remaining enrolment checks. Use the institution’s instructions and your competent consular authority together.",{"children":"For relevant non-EU students abroad, UniTo identifies a separate Universitaly pre-enrolment process. Admission and university validation do not guarantee a visa, and a visa does not remove the university’s remaining enrolment checks. Use the institution’s instructions and your competent consular authority together."}],["$","p","List what is still missing after the offer: final degree evidence, any accepted comparability documentation, language evidence, pre-enrolment and final enrolment steps. Ask for the precise deadline and accepted format for each. This is more useful than assuming that an acceptance PDF finishes the process.",{"children":"List what is still missing after the offer: final degree evidence, any accepted comparability documentation, language evidence, pre-enrolment and final enrolment steps. Ask for the precise deadline and accepted format for each. This is more useful than assuming that an acceptance PDF finishes the process."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L2c",null,{"id":"guides/university-of-turin-admissions-scholarships:section-8","title":"Check your progress","items":["Programme offer and conditions understood.","Universitaly task identified where applicable.","Original/recognition documents tracked.","Funding and housing applications completed separately.","Final enrolment instructions saved."]}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for After an offer: Universitaly, originals and enrolment","children":[["$","$L5","/guides/universitaly-pre-enrolment/",{"href":"/guides/universitaly-pre-enrolment/","children":["Universitaly step-by-step guide",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/guides/cimea-vs-declaration-of-value-italy/",{"href":"/guides/cimea-vs-declaration-of-value-italy/","children":["CIMEA and Declaration of Value comparison",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
